  {
    "id": 1201,
    "meta": {
      "type": "lea.JourneyPage",
      "slug": "apply-for-a-school-place",
      "locale": "en",
      "alias_of": null,
      "parent": { "id": 1104 }
    },
    "title": "Apply for a school place",
    "summary": "Apply for a primary school place in one of the five pilot regions. Takes 20 to 25 minutes and cannot be saved part-way.",
    "highlighted": true,
    "body": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "value": "<p>Use this service to apply for a primary school place for your child in one of the five pilot regions for the 2026/27 school year.</p>",
        "id": "j-1201-intro"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Getting ready to apply",
        "id": "j-1201-h1"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "value": "<p><b>Before you start, you will need:</b></p><ul><li>your child's PPS number and date of birth</li><li>your child's birth certificate (JPG, PDF, PNG or TIFF, maximum 10MB)</li><li>two proofs of address dated within the last 30 days, such as utility bills or bank statements</li><li>if you are applying for a Special Class place, a professional diagnosis report and NCSE confirmation letter</li></ul>",
        "id": "j-1201-p1"
      },
      {
        "type": "button_link",
        "value": [
          {
            "type": "external_link",
            "value": {
              "link_url": "https://forms.uat.services.gov.ie/en/school-place-application",
              "link_text": "Start application"
            },
            "id": "j-1201-cta"
          }
        ],
        "id": "j-1201-b1"
      },
      { "type": "heading", "value": "How long it takes", "id": "j-1201-h2" },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "value": "<p>This application takes approximately 20 to 25 minutes to complete. You cannot save and return, so have everything ready before you begin.</p>",
        "id": "j-1201-p2"
      },
      { "type": "heading", "value": "Application window", "id": "j-1201-h3" },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "value": "<p>Applications for the 2026/27 school year open 1 October and close 22 October 2026. Applications submitted after this date will not be accepted.</p>",
        "id": "j-1201-p3"
      },
      { "type": "heading", "value": "What happens next", "id": "j-1201-h4" },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "value": "<ul><li>round 1 offers will be issued on 12 November 2026</li><li>round 2 offers will be issued on 4 December 2026</li></ul><p>You will receive a message when a decision is available. Open it in your messages to read the decision securely.</p>",
        "id": "j-1201-p4"
      }
    ]
  },
